  "title": "UK Heatwave Crisis: Thousands Forced to Find Unusual Ways to Escape Overheating Homes",
  "summary": "Poor housing, rising temperatures, and limited cooling options leave many UK residents struggling during extreme heat As temperatures continue to rise across the UK, many households are facing a hidden consequence of extreme weather: homes that become dangerously hot and difficult to live in. New research has revealed that a significant number of people are taking unusual measures to cope with heatwaves, including sleeping in kitchens, moving outdoors, booking hotel rooms and even missing work",
